{"updated":"2026-10-08T15:03:53.655Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Arizona congressional candidate says she was raped while repairing campaign sign. Elsewhere, search warrants for former prince Andrew's homes were unlawful, UK court rules. And new York Mayor Mamdani under fire for attending October 7 vigil. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 1.4 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.4 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 3.8 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 37 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.3 near 102 km NE of Norsup, Vanuatu. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.1,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.29,0.35,0.4,0.43,0.48,0.53,0.56,0.59,0.63,0.65,0.7,0.81,0.91,1.06,1.3,1.42,1.46,1.49,1.51,1.56,1.58,1.6,1.63,1.67,1.72,1.78,1.85,1.89,1.93,1.96,2.01,2.04,2.08,2.14,2.18,2.22,2.25,2.31,2.36,2.4,2.45,2.5,2.54,2.6,2.67,2.79,2.88,3,3.03,3.06,3.1,3.15,3.19,3.25,3.34,3.42,3.48,3.55,3.6,3.65,3.69,3.74,3.79,3.81,3.83,3.88,3.9,3.92,3.95,3.99,4.04,4.12,4.18,4.24,4.32,4.38,4.47,4.52,4.57,4.6,4.66,4.77,4.92,5.1,5.61,5.72,5.79,5.85,5.92,6,6.06,6.12,6.19,6.22,6.27,6.33,6.38,6.44,6.48,6.51,6.56,6.59,6.63,6.66,6.71,6.76,6.82,6.86,6.93,6.98,7.02,7.08,7.13,7.19,7.23,7.35,7.44,7.54,7.59,7.63,7.66,7.71,7.74,7.78,7.8,7.85,7.88,7.93,7.96,8.05,8.12,8.2,8.26,8.3,8.32,8.35,8.38,8.43,8.46,8.51,8.53,8.58,8.62,8.67,8.73,8.79,8.85,8.9,8.95,8.97,9.01,9.07,9.11,9.2,9.29,9.36,9.42,9.45,9.5,9.55,9.63,9.68,9.86,9.91,10.01,10.18,10.62,10.74,10.8,10.86,10.9,10.94,10.99,11.03,11.09,11.2,11.23,11.38,11.46,11.54,11.56,11.61,11.67,11.7,11.74,11.77,11.83,11.87,11.9,11.94,11.97,12.01,12.04,12.07,12.11,12.14,12.18,12.24,12.28,12.34,12.4,12.45,12.49,12.52,12.56,